# glslangValidator -V --vn <name> into generated/), so SurfaceFlinger composes the layer in the display hardware
# (DEVICE) instead of rotating it on the GPU (CLIENT). Redmi 10C menu: 33.5 -> 35.8 fps. DXVK_NO_PRETRANSFORM=1: off.
